BT /F2 15 Tf 50 754 Td (Portal user guide) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 728 Td (This guide explains how authorised Belgravia Sports Club portal users can sign in, find a user) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 715 Td (record, and understand the access information shown in the portal.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 695 Td (The portal is an administrative information and access-management tool. It is not a self-service) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 682 Td (membership registration page or a button for opening a door. Your available actions depend on) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 669 Td (the role assigned to your portal account.) Tj ET
BT /F2 15 Tf 50 644 Td (1. Sign in) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 618 Td (1. Open the portal using the web address supplied by Belgravia Sports Club.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 605 Td (2. Select Login if you are not already on the sign-in page.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 592 Td (3. Enter the username and password supplied by your portal administrator, then select Login.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 579 Td (4. Check the username and role shown in the top navigation. Select Logout when you have) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 566 Td (finished, especially on a shared device.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 546 Td (Portal accounts are created by an administrator; there is no self-registration link. If you) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 533 Td (cannot sign in, your account is inactive, or you have forgotten your password, contact your) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 520 Td (portal administrator or use the support contacts at the end of this guide. Do not send your) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 507 Td (password to anyone.) Tj ET
BT /F2 15 Tf 50 482 Td (2. Understand your role) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 456 Td (- Viewer ? can view user connections, account details, linked access IDs, access decisions, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 443 Td (  recorded access events.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 430 Td (- Staff ? has Viewer access and can manage mappings, linked access IDs, and a user's access) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 417 Td (  decision.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 404 Td (- Admin ? has Staff access and can also manage portal users, application settings, and user) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 391 Td (  synchronisation.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 371 Td (The role shown beside your username indicates your portal permissions. Portal roles are separate) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 358 Td (from physical membership and do not themselves guarantee that a credential will open a door.) Tj ET
BT /F2 15 Tf 50 333 Td (3. Find a user) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 307 Td (After signing in, the User Connections page shows the user list and summary counts.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 287 Td (1. Open Quick actions to see the search and filter controls.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 274 Td (2. Search by a name, accounting user ID, narration/display name, or access ID. You can also) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 261 Td (filter by Connected / Not Connected status and Staff / Member classification.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 248 Td (3. Select Filter to apply your choices, or Clear to remove them.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 235 Td (4. If results span more than one page, use the page links below the list.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 222 Td (5. Select View beside a record to open its details.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 202 Td (The list can show the user's name, classification, balances, whether an access ID is linked, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 189 Td (the current access-decision type. Information such as balances is account information; it is not) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 176 Td (a real-time device status.) Tj ET
BT /F2 15 Tf 50 151 Td (4. Read a user's details) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 125 Td (The details page may include:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 105 Td (- Account details ? the accounting user ID, name, classification, and available account) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 92 Td (  information.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 79 Td (- Mapping access decision ? whether the record uses Auto, a manual Grant, or a manual Reject.) Tj ET
