BT /F1 10 Tf 50 785 Td (- Linked access IDs ? credential identifier, authentication type \(for example, card, biometric,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 772 Td (  or PIN\), assigned device/location, configured device status, and last successful sync if) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 759 Td (  recorded.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 746 Td (- Access summary and events/logs ? recorded grant/reject decisions and event details, including) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 733 Td (  time and device where known.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 713 Td (Use Back to User Connections to return to the list. Events are records of attempts attributed to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 700 Td (that user; an event list may not include unattributed attempts.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 50 675 Td (What the status labels mean) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 654 Td (- Connected means an access ID is linked to the user. It does not mean access is currently) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 641 Td (  granted.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 628 Td (- Not Connected means the portal has no enabled linked access ID for that user.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 615 Td (- Active / Inactive is the device's configured status, not a live connectivity test.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 602 Td (- Last successful sync shows the last successful device sync recorded by the portal. It may not) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 589 Td (  reflect the device's current state.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 576 Td (- Grant / Reject is the recorded access decision. If no events are shown, the portal has no) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 563 Td (  recorded event attributed to that mapping.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 50 538 Td (Automatic and manual decisions) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 517 Td (- Auto uses the club's configured authorisation rules. In Auto, Staff are granted access;) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 504 Td (  Members are evaluated using those rules.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 491 Td (- A manual Grant or Reject overrides the automatic decision for every access ID linked to that) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 478 Td (  mapping.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 465 Td (- A disconnected ID or inactive device still rejects access. A device that is offline receives) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 452 Td (  changes at its next successful sync, so updates may not take effect immediately.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 432 Td (If you believe a decision or user record is wrong, contact the club or portal administrator. Do) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 419 Td (not attempt to correct a record unless your role and club procedures authorise you to do so.) Tj ET
BT /F2 15 Tf 50 394 Td (5. Staff and Admin actions) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 368 Td (Only users with the appropriate role see management controls.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 348 Td (- Staff can create or edit mappings, connect or update access IDs, disconnect linked IDs, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 335 Td (  save a manual access decision. Review the selected user, credential, device, and decision) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 322 Td (  before saving. A disconnected ID is protected from automatic reconnection; reconnect it) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 309 Td (  through Connect access ID if authorised.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 296 Td (- Admin can also use Portal users to create or edit portal accounts and roles, use Settings to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 283 Td (  manage authorisation configuration, and synchronise user data from the accounting system.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 270 Td (- When an administrator synchronises users, the list may be updated and users deleted from the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 257 Td (  external accounting system may be removed. Use this action only when authorised and when the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 244 Td (  club's procedures call for it.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 231 Td (- Some changes are applied to a device only when that device next synchronises. Do not promise) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 218 Td (  an immediate access change based only on a successful save in the portal.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 198 Td (If a management control is missing, your role may not permit that action. Contact an) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 185 Td (administrator rather than sharing login details or using another person's account.) Tj ET
BT /F2 15 Tf 50 160 Td (6. Get help) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 134 Td (When reporting a problem, include the user's name or accounting user ID, the approximate time of) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 121 Td (the attempt, the location/device if known, and the decision displayed by the portal. Share) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 108 Td (credential identifiers or personal information only through a private, approved channel. Never) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 95 Td (include your portal password.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 75 Td (- Support phone / WhatsApp: +263 787 470 156 \(+263787470156\)) Tj ET
